Package: GRAFS
Type: Package
Title: Automated GRAFS Diagram Plotter
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person(
    "Alfredo", "Rodriguez",
    email = "alfredo.rodriguez@uclm.es",
    role = c("aut", "cre")
  )
Description: Automates the creation of GRAFS (General Representation of
    Agro-Food Systems) diagrams as described by Billen et al. (2014),
    Lassaletta et al. (2015), and Le Noe et al. (2017). Reads flow data
    from CSV files, populates a draw.io XML template with proportional arrow
    widths and labels, and exports the result as PNG images. Requires the
    draw.io desktop application (<https://github.com/jgraph/drawio-desktop>)
    to be installed separately.
